<title>NORWAY: Aker 8-month result per division.</title>
<headline>Aker 8-month result per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aker 8-month result per division: Aker Oil and Gas Technology</p>
