<p>Aker ASA and other activity</p>
<p> Operating revenue		    369   vs	1,577</p>
<p> Operating result		    -105   vs	  142</p>
<p> Result after financial items    -201   vs	  294</p>
<p>NOTE - Aker said 1995 figures were pro forma because of changes in the company structure.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
